WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.877 --> 00:00:04.796
- The night...
a shadowy world

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.342
that hides more than
half the animals on our planet.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:09.885
(thunder rumbles)

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:14.056
Until now, cameras only offered
a glimpse into their lives.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.182
(trumpets)

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:19.686
- But, with next generation technology,
we can see the night...

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:21.772
(hyena chuckles)

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:26.401
(thunder crashes)

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:29.446
- ...as clear as day.

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:33.283
♪ In the dead of night ♪

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.452
♪ Strange things happen ♪

00:00:35.536 --> 00:00:38.288
♪ In the dead of night ♪

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:41.792
♪ Better hold on tight ♪

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:46.922
- Filming just by the light of the moon
will test the crew to their limits.

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.131
- Currently stuck in the ice.

00:00:48.215 --> 00:00:53.095
- To capture the lives of animals,
and their nocturnal journeys, in color.

00:00:53.679 --> 00:00:57.266
- I think the book on jaguar behavior
is being written right here.

00:00:57.349 --> 00:00:59.643
- So nice to see what they do at night.
It's so special.

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:03.730
- It turns us humans...
into nocturnal animals.

00:01:03.814 --> 00:01:04.857
(snarls)

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:08.318
♪ In the dead of night ♪

00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:10.445
♪ Strange things happen ♪

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:13.448
♪ In the dead of night ♪

00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:16.368
♪ The world goes cold ♪

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:19.621
- Discover Earth's last true wilderness.

00:01:19.705 --> 00:01:22.457
♪ Better hold on tight ♪

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:25.878
- The night.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:29.256
♪ In the dead of night ♪

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:31.550
♪ Strange things happen ♪

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:34.511
♪ In the dead of night ♪

00:01:34.595 --> 00:01:37.472
♪ Better hold on tight ♪

